# ── Secrets: camera RTSP credentials ──────────────────────────────────────────
# _rtsp.json holds resolved rtsp:// URLs with inline camera passwords, and the
# go2rtc backups inline the same credentials plus the Kasa basic-auth blobs.
# The whole backups/ dir is local scratch: the configuration.yaml and lovelace
# dumps carry the same inline credentials, so ignore it wholesale rather than
# per-pattern.
cast_mock/_rtsp.json
backups/
go2rtc.yaml

